 rette-sprinkl'd trans woman with a bullet-spitting spitfire of a…set.' (T
 heMumble.uk). Through unrequited wishes shaped by gender dysphoria\, she co
 nfronts psychotherapists\, psychiatrists and clinical gatekeeping in pursui
 t of diagnosis – while sharing moments of grief so intense they nearly le
 ad to her sectioning. Expect laughter\, heartbreak and truth told without a
 pology.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/she-beast-wi
 p/
